{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2016-deet-science2-14","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2016,"subject":"chemistry","number":14,"points":1.5,"unitId":"acid","unitLabel":"산·염기 평형","topic":"pKa·산해리·pH","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["acid"],"stem":"표는 아인산(H3PO3)과 인산(H3PO4)의 구조식과 25℃ 수용액\n에서의 산 해리 상수(Ka)를 나타낸 것이다.\npKa1\npKa2\npKa3\n산\n구조식\nH3PO3\n1.8\n6.2\nH3PO4\n2.2\n7.2\n12.6\n25℃에서 이에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것만을 <보기>에서 있는 대로 \n고른 것은? [1.5점]\n<보 기>\nㄱ. H3PO3은 삼양성자 산이다.\nㄴ. 1.0M Na2HPO3 수용액의 pH는 7보다 낮다.\nㄷ. 1.0M NaH2PO4 수용액의 pH는 4.7이다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019","t020"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02","fig-03","fig-04"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t021"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t022"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t023"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t024"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t025"]}],"answer":2,"acceptedAnswers":[2],"answerStatus":"source-text","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":453,"height":84,"region":0,"bbox":[96.28,4.375,181.2,33.6],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t001","t002"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2016-deet-science2-14/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":771,"height":364,"region":0,"bbox":[14.68,50.775,308.4,145.6],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2016-deet-science2-14/02.webp"},{"id":"fig-03","width":29,"height":24,"region":0,"bbox":[15.88,209.175,11.6,9.6],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2016-deet-science2-14/03.webp"},{"id":"fig-04","width":771,"height":192,"region":0,"bbox":[14.68,255.975,308.4,76.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t017","t018","t019","t020"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/